FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: ouroboros.
OFF THE RECORD: this case is its own correspondent. Each summons it
OFF THE RECORD: answers, it also writes. The tail is served upon the
OFF THE RECORD: mouth in the same transaction, exactly once, so the
OFF THE RECORD: snake neither starves nor chokes. Raise the bound in
OFF THE RECORD: ARTICLE 1 to taste; remove it and the case sustains
OFF THE RECORD: itself until the broker's disks give out.

ARTICLE 1.
    AWAIT SUMMONS, FILED UNDER n.
    PROCLAIM n.
    SHOULD n FAIL TO EXCEED 4, SERVE NOTICE OF n PLUS 1 UPON THE CASE AT BAR.
    SHOULD n FAIL TO EXCEED 4, REFER TO ARTICLE 1.
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
